主要终点:
The Incidence of Major Adverse Cardiovascular Events (MACE) Between Initiators of CONTRAVE®/MYSIMBA® or N&B and Initiators of Lorcaserin.

The primary study endpoint is MACE, defined as the composite of:

* Medically attended non-fatal acute myocardial infarction (AMI);
* Medically attended non-fatal stroke;
* Cardiovascular death.

Up to 113 months

